{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0149","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0149:00000122:text","row":25630,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「そんな鬼畜な俺を、冬子は気に入ってくれたんだろ？」","en":"“But you fell for a sick bastard like me, didn’t you?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009081","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2013:00171","en":"Touko: \"So, Touko, you did like the brute version of me didn't you?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0149:00000193:text","row":25631,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「鬼畜だから好きになったわけじゃないわよ」","en":"“I didn’t fall for you because you’re a sick bastard.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009082","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2013:00172","en":"Touko: \"I didn't fall in love because you're some brute you know!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0149:000001fa:text","row":25632,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ちゃんと、まっこうから付き合ってくれたから」","en":"“...Because you really faced me head-on.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009083","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2013:00173","en":"Touko: \"...but because you properly and straightforwardly dated me.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["name_address"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0149:00000244:text","row":25633,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"まっこうから、か。","en":"Head-on, huh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009084","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2013:00174","en":"Straightforwards was I, now.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0149:0000026e:text","row":25634,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"実験だったとはいえないよな。","en":"I can’t exactly tell her it was all an experiment.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:009085","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb2013:00175","en":"I cannot say that it was an experiment.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0149:000002a2:text","row":25635,"ordinal":6,